    "verb endings"
   ],
   "rule": null,
   "text": "The ending shows the person and the level of respect. The simple present covers habits and general truths; the continuous (**-ছি, -ছ, -ছে, -ছেন**) is what's happening now, and also \"have been doing\": **দুই ঘণ্টা ধরে পড়ছি**.",
