    "খেয়েছি"
   ],
   "rule": null,
   "text": "The future is **-ব/-বে/-বেন**. The present perfect (**-েছি**) is used for recent, finished actions with a result now, more often than English: **আমি খেয়েছি** (I've eaten). Its negative is **-নি** on the simple present: **আমি খাইনি** (I haven't eaten).",
