   ],
   "rule": null,
   "text": "**না** follows the verb: **খাব না** (I won't eat). For the past, use **-নি** on the present form, not the past ending. **আছে** (there is, has) has the negative **নেই**; the dropped \"is\" has its own negative **নয়**.",
   "tables": [
    {
     "head": [
      "Word",
      "Use",
      "Example"
     ],
     "rows": [
      [
       "না",
       "after most verbs",
