  {
   "number": 11,
   "id": "conjunctive",
   "title": "Linking actions: -ে (having done) & যদি",
   "kind": "verbs",
   "level": "B1",
   "tags": [
    "conjunctive participle",
    "এ",
    "করে",
    "খেয়ে",
    "গিয়ে",
    "যদি",
    "তাহলে",
    "condition",
    "if"
   ],
   "rule": null,
   "text": "A verb ending in **-ে** (করে, খেয়ে, গিয়ে) links actions: \"having done this, then…\". Conditions use **যদি… তাহলে**, or just the **-লে** form: **বৃষ্টি হলে আমরা যাব না** (if it rains, we won't go).",
   "tables": [],
   "after": null,
   "examples": [
